WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.324
Today is the final check. It takes about three minutes.

2
00:00:03.774 --> 00:00:07.246
Your child reads from their page. You have the grown-up page.

3
00:00:07.696 --> 00:00:09.518
For each word, tick one box.

4
00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:11.090
Do not help today.

5
00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:18.032
The eight new words matter most. Your child has never seen them, so reading them means they are really blending.

6
00:00:18.482 --> 00:00:20.692
Slow counts. Sounding it out counts.

7
00:00:21.142 --> 00:00:25.340
Your page tells you what the result means, and exactly what to do next.

8
00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:29.793
Then put this page beside the page from day one, and look at them together.
